# Bassclef-cli .npmignore
#
# The published package.json `files` field is the primary allowlist.
# This file exists to override npm's .gitignore-fallback behavior which
# would otherwise filter out dist/lite/.gitignore (part of the walker's
# template set — adopters need it).
#
# Left mostly empty on purpose. package.json files: [] is authoritative.

# Explicitly nothing — files field controls what ships.
